==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*stojiti}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|сто́ить}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-стоить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|сто́ить|impf}}

# to [[cost]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[это|Э́то]] '''сто́ит''' [[большой|больши́х]] [[деньги|де́нег]].|It '''costs''' a lot of money.}}
# to [[be]] [[worth]]
# to be [[worthy]] of, to [[deserve]]
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1905|author=Фёдор Кузьмич Сологуб ([[w:Fyodor Sologub|Fyodor Kuzmich Sologub]])|title=[[s:ru:Благоуханное имя (Сологуб)|Благоуханное имя]]|trans-title=[[s:The Sweet-Scented Name/The Sweet-Scented Name|The Sweet-Scented Name]]|text=— [[ты|Ты]] '''сто́ишь''' [[тот|того́]], [[что́бы]] [[носи́ть]] [[благоуханный|благоуха́нное]] [[и́мя]], [[и]] нехорошо́, [[что]] [[ты]] [[Маргари́та]], — [[но]] [[у]] люде́й [[нет]] [[для]] [[ты|тебя́]] и́мени.|t="You '''deserve''' to bear a sweet-scented name; it is not good that you are Margarita, but among humans there is no name for you."}}
# {{lb|ru|idiomatic|impersonal}} {{m|ru||сто́ит то́лько}} {{+obj|ru|dat<for someone> + inf<to do something>}}
## it is [[sufficient]] (for some purpose), all you have to do is, one need only
## [[once]] (one thing happens another thing certainly happens)

====Usage notes====
* Not to be confused with most of the conjugation forms pertaining to {{m|ru|стоя́ть}}.

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf|4a|сто́ить|ppp=-|prpp=-}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|сто́имость|g=f}}
